# Data Layer

SQLite via Drizzle ORM. Schema is in `db/schema.ts`.

- `db/queries.ts` — reads
- `db/inserts.ts` — inserts
- `db/updates.ts` — updates
- `db/deletions.ts` — deletes

Migrations live in `drizzle/` and run on startup from `app/_layout.tsx`. After a schema change, run `npx drizzle-kit generate`. Do not edit migration files by hand. Renames go in a new migration.
